		(property "Notes" "RESOLVED 2026-07-31: clip-mode decode implemented as 3-relay tree K401-K403 (TQ2-5V). K401 coil=MODE_B routes CLIP_NODE_L/R to W0 (NC) or W1 (NO); K402 coil=MODE_A on W0: NC=open=Clean, NO=LED; K403 coil=MODE_A on W1: NC=Si, NO=Ge. Truth table 00=Clean 01=Si 10=LED 11=Ge preserved mechanically - Clean mode guaranteed by open contacts."
			(at 86.36 121.92 0)
