    (property "Notes" "Clip-mode relay decode tree (added 2026-07-31), spec truth table 00=Clean 01=Si 10=LED 11=Ge. K401 (coil=MODE_B) routes CLIP_NODE to W0 (NC) or W1 (NO). K402 (coil=MODE_A) on W0: NC=open(Clean), NO=LED. K403 (coil=MODE_A) on W1: NC=Si, NO=Ge. Coils direct-driven from switched +5VAUX; polarized coils, + to A1; flybacks D421/D422." (at 198.12 114.3 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))
